  "causation_limit": "053admission did reopen, but geometryreason7 prevented every draw. Existing fixture omitted a real DEFAULT buffer across recovery. Actual original overlapping callback pair remains unknown; new bounded op and geometry-revocation diagnostics distinguish it. Unsupported missed native writes remain fail-closed; no stale masks or invented geometry. All4stable/beta hardware combinations and Auto/fixedresolution remain requirements, not newly verified claims.",
